invariant: INV-13
file: handshake_post.c
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_test
reason: hspost_read returns CH_RECORD_AGAIN for a message split across
  records without writing post_fill, so the next ch_read reads the
  second part as a new message, fails to parse it and kills the session.

--- old
            t->post_fill = fill;
            return rc;
--- new
            return rc;
